{"id": "u9f509700dd", "url": "https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/delta-tech-issues-thanksgiving-travel-rcna610685", "source": "NBC News", "title": "Delta restores system after nationwide flight delays as Thanksgiving travel begins", "byline": "Jay Blackman", "date": "Nov 22", "image": "https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_nbcnews-fp-1200-630,f_auto,q_auto:best/rockcms/2026-11/261122-atlanta-delta-airport-ww-1543-e2c97b.jpg", "thumb": "9f509700dd.jpg", "html": "<p>Delta Air Lines said it restored an automated system Sunday afternoon after a problem with it delayed flights nationwide as Thanksgiving travel got underway.</p>\n    <p>A of 4 p.m. ET, more than 1,100 flights into and out of Hartsfield-Jackson Atlanta International Airport had been delayed and 36 had been canceled, according to FlightAware.</p>\n    <p>The airline, which has 5,000 Delta and Delta connection flights scheduled for Sunday, said 70% of the delays and cancellations are connected to the automation issue. It attributed the rest to bad weather and other air traffic control restrictions in New York and elsewhere in the Northeast.</p>\n    <p>The system calculates how much a plane weighs and how that weight is distributed before takeoff.</p>\n    <p>The Federal Aviation Administration briefly halted Atlanta-bound flights Sunday morning, then allowed them to depart at staggered times. The delay program applied to Delta and its regional carriers flying into Hartsfield-Jackson from the contiguous United States. The FAA had projected delays of 57 minutes on average and lasting up to 1 hour and 51 minutes.</p>\n    <img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_focal-760x1140,f_avif,q_auto:best/rockcms/2026-11/261122-atlanta-delta-airport-ww-1544-a4afae.jpg\" alt=\"A pilot walking by Delta kiosks in a blur.\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <p>At 11:26 a.m. ET, the agency lifted the delay program.</p>\n    <p>Delta said it was rebooking passengers and providing meals and hotel rooms where needed. Passengers whose flights were canceled could get a refund if they chose not to travel.</p>\n    <img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_focal-260x130,f_avif,q_auto:best/rockcms/2026-11/261120-jamie-davis-louisiana-ww-1429-aa344b.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <h3><img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2026-01/asterisk-43f04b.svg\" loading=\"lazy\">FOR SUBSCRIBERS</h3>\n    <img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_focal-260x130,f_avif,q_auto:best/rockcms/2026-11/261123-Merkury-rs-bf342b.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <h3><img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2026-01/asterisk-43f04b.svg\" loading=\"lazy\">FOR SUBSCRIBERS</h3>\n    <img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_focal-260x130,f_avif,q_auto:best/rockcms/2026-11/261116-christian-bale-madden-sjr-1233-1dc9fd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <h3><img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2026-01/asterisk-43f04b.svg\" loading=\"lazy\">FOR SUBSCRIBERS</h3>\n    <img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_focal-260x130,f_avif,q_auto:best/rockcms/2026-07/260729-shenzhen-rs-7301ed.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <h3><img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2026-01/asterisk-43f04b.svg\" loading=\"lazy\">FOR SUBSCRIBERS</h3>\n    <img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_focal-260x130,f_avif,q_auto:best/rockcms/2026-07/260720-frankford-arsenal-ew-650p-e3fbbb.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <h3><img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2026-01/asterisk-43f04b.svg\" loading=\"lazy\">FOR SUBSCRIBERS</h3>\n    <img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_focal-260x130,f_avif,q_auto:best/rockcms/2025-11/251106-faa-flights-slash-lr-4efba4.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <h3><img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2026-01/asterisk-43f04b.svg\" loading=\"lazy\">FOR 