2026-01/asterisk-43f04b.svg\" loading=\"lazy\">FOR SUBSCRIBERS</h3>\n    <img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_focal-260x130,f_avif,q_auto:best/rockcms/2026-11/261118-cybersecurity-vsb-2314-263fc7.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <h3><img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2026-01/asterisk-43f04b.svg\" loading=\"lazy\">FOR SUBSCRIBERS</h3>\n    <img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_focal-260x130,f_avif,q_auto:best/rockcms/2026-11/261116-reagan-airport-mb-0935-c48bcd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <h3><img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2026-01/asterisk-43f04b.svg\" loading=\"lazy\">FOR SUBSCRIBERS</h3>\n    <img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_focal-260x130,f_avif,q_auto:best/rockcms/2026-11/261119-Justin-Herbert-vsb-2004-e15fb6.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <h3><img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2026-01/asterisk-43f04b.svg\" loading=\"lazy\">FOR SUBSCRIBERS</h3>\n    <img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_focal-260x130,f_avif,q_auto:best/rockcms/2026-11/261119-aoc-kamala-split-ww-1149-5f03e6.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <h3><img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2026-01/asterisk-43f04b.svg\" loading=\"lazy\">FOR SUBSCRIBERS</h3>\n    <img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_focal-260x130,f_avif,q_auto:best/rockcms/2026-11/261120-dateline-only-fans-lr-770ed6.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <h3><img src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/rockcms/2026-01/asterisk-43f04b.svg\" loading=\"lazy\">FOR SUBSCRIBERS</h3>\n    <p>Hartsfield-Jackson said the disruption was limited to Delta and did not affect airport operations broadly. The airport urged travelers to check their flight status with their airline and arrive at least two hours before domestic flights and three hours before international flights.</p>\n    <p>Cirium, an aviation analytics company that monitored ground stops, said Delta canceled 4% of its flights, or 202 total, departing from the U.S. Sunday, which is higher than average for the airline. Only 50% of its flights arrived on time today, it said.</p>\n    <p>Sunday’s disruption followed a nationwide ground stop on Nov. 13 caused by a technical issue with the FAA’s air traffic control network. Flights resumed later that evening, but travel disruptions continued through the weekend.</p>\n    <p>A separate system outage delayed United Airlines departures on Nov. 16, disrupting crew communications and the airline’s ability to send pilots final aircraft weight data, according to the union representing United pilots. United said it resolved the issue that day.</p>\n  ", "word_count": 438, "status": "full", "reason": null, "summary": "More than 1,100 flights into and out of Delta’s Atlanta hub had been delayed by Sunday afternoon.", "extracted_at": "2026-11-23T05:37:30-0500", "http": "200"}